& =3{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}Δ{x}_{i}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that ${\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}Δ{x}_{i}$ and ${\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}Δ{y}_{j}$ are just the lengths of the intervals $[0,1]$ and $[1,2]$ respectively. So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}Δ{x}_{i} & =1-0=1, \\\\ {\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}Δ{y}_{j} & =2-1=1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nCombining our results, we have \n\n$$\n3{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}Δ{x}_{i}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}Δ{y}_{j}=3\\cdot 1\\cdot 1=3.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-72476/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9f913fab-d0b5-5e9e-b292-039afe4a148c"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-72476"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-149628/selection/a84d639d380e10cb74c92005685f9f65779377dfb51342c280c63c645679bbea" :answer/id #uuid "ea4d1d27-c89c-5b12-b4cf-fadc0b39cc29" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "25" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-149628/selection/0f0db3a18f1d79c4863315eefe754cc5306e04e7aeebf4414ffedb95d6f1bc97" :answer/id #uuid "c3f62adf-e17f-56fe-a9cf-f8819012fb40" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-149628/selection/a38ef12f135c1e6010d68ed21f81bc27372a73a756455b7066f6182c46018cc8" :answer/id #uuid "8b6105c6-62e5-5d68-afb6-e9e032780abd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "32" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-149628/selection/0fbe558572ecce67593db00d22f0d8d9d09c98d019451cd13488790a441e6c9c" :answer/id #uuid "479f0c61-f04f-50dc-8018-4d8aebc94d84" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-149628/selection/650efaaa01beaa7de6c030497edff1dd29c570bf683f3726bbcacabc3dfa7e4c" :answer/id #uuid "498f7d2d-acdc-54b5-b4a5-9fcdfe77446f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "16" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-149628/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "8cfa5b14-2100-5b67-992f-78d10d2